@title Part terminals: "do not ask again" switches the offer off for the project and Project > Rules switches it on (1366x768)
@area Parts
@sizes 1366x768
# Fixture as in 2416 with two QA relays that both have terminals a1 and A2. The first assignment opens the offer; "Keep, and do not ask again in this project" closes it. Assigning the second relay then opens nothing. Project > Rules > Usual pin names has a checkbox that switches the offer on again; the next assignment opens it.
user_catalog qa/fixtures/pin-offer-parts.json
open qa/fixtures/pin-offer.kopercad
wait 30
key ctrl+a
wait 20
click_text "Choose..."
wait 20
click_text "QA QA-REL-1"
wait 20
expect "Name the terminals like the pins"
shot offer
click_text "Keep, and do not ask again in this project"
wait 20
shot never
expect_not "Name the terminals like the pins"
expect "Will not ask again in this project"
click_text "Change..."
wait 20
click_text "QA QA-REL-2"
wait 20
shot second-part-quiet
expect_not "Name the terminals like the pins"
key ctrl+k
wait 10
text rules
wait 10
key Return
wait 20
scroll 680 400 -600
wait 10
shot rules-off
click_text "Offer to rename a part's terminals after a part is assigned"
wait 10
shot rules-on
click_text "Done"
wait 20
click_text "Change..."
wait 20
click_text "QA QA-REL-1"
wait 20
shot offer-again
expect "Name the terminals like the pins"
check_layout
